  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Tom and Ben are in the park. \"Hi, Ben!\" says Tom. \"Hi, Tom!\" \"Let's play football!\" says Tom. \"Yes!\" says Ben. Tom has a red ball.",
      "Tom kicks the ball. Ben runs. Ben catches the ball. Ben throws the ball to Tom. \"Is it fun?\" asks Tom. \"Yes, it is fun!\" says Ben. Pip runs and jumps. \"Woof!\" says Pip.",
      "Pip runs to the ball. Tom and Ben walk to Pip. \"Bye, Ben!\" says Tom. \"Bye, Tom! See you!\" Ben is Tom's friend. Tom is happy."
    ],
    "summary": "Tom and Ben play football in the park with a red ball. Pip runs and jumps. Then the two friends say bye.",
